<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">1 DZAÃ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan wu ɛ̃kwel wa Dzaã</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Dzaã</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Dz</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan wu ɛ̃kwel wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Dzaã</para>
  <para style="imt1">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu, wu áswɛn ndɛ eli ntam Dzaã. Ndɛ wu Dzaã olieel ndiri ndɛ oli ngɔmɔ̃ onse baal b'áyoo bvool b'ámwɛn Endɔɔ me mviil ã bam (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 1:1">1.1</ref></char>). Ndɛ oswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu ol'akiool b'ásam onse ɛ̃tsab m'ãtee ã baal b'ãbedzeel bakyɛ. Ndɛ oti bɔ m'«ataal a Mãsia» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 2:18">2.18</ref></char>), me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ abebee ndiri Yeso k'áyi m'emfa ki ombuul wɛ. Bɔ asa obi k'abveel kuul mbee wɛ. Bɔ hɛ̃ k'abal etumbu ki ewa Nziã b'asa obi wɛ. Bɔ bvool apfiɔɔl emfa kyɛn akiool ebvaan akal. Baal obɔ ali onse nkel a anga-ãyal, b'abetal ãndɔɔ m'ãbuɛɛn. Abeta bɔ me nkel a baal b'abetsam ndiri bɔ akoo k'ayɛɛ Nziã me nkuul a oyɛɛ bɛn k'okiool ndiri Yeso áyi m'emfa ki ombuul wɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dzaã oyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan wu ola ãnsam ye baan, y'atal b'Ebvɔɔn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 2:12-17">2.12-17</ref></char>). Otsɛn b'eswɛn ndɛ ndɛ oli ba: Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, Dzaã odzii k'awa ɔ̃mveel me ndɔɔ enkyam y'ãtee m'ãtal owuaal o baal. Ndɛ hɛ̃ odzii k'aseel baal nkuul bvool awɛɛl bɔ. Ntam Dzaã ayɛɛn y'akiool k'asɛn ãnã onse Endɔɔ li eyoo bɔ fa obɛɛn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 2:24">2.24</ref></char>). Ndɔɔ yi nkiin yi elieel ndɛ eli yi: «Mɛ̃ nkel byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn byɛ eli y'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu, byɛ b'eli y'okiool me nkuũ a Muaan a Nziã» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 5:13">5.13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Dzaã awa eliĩ bvi esuo kwɛn mbuul oli ɔ̃kilisito (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 4:2">4.2</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:3">2.3</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:14">3.14</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ãndɔɔ m'eyɛɛn ndɛ onse ɔ̃nkaan wu ãyi nkuul mɔ̃ ye m'éswɛn ndɛ onse ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ wa Nsia yi Ngesɛ. Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ bvel-bvel ãtal dzii (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 2:3-11">2.3-11</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:11-24">3.11-24</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 4:7-21">4.7-21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndɛ olweel ãndɔɔ ãnkyam m'ãsuo baal k'abal obi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 1:5-2:2">1.5–2.2</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:12-19">2.12-19</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:19-3:10">2.19–3.10</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:16-20">5.16-20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Endɔɔ li elaã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1" />Yi éli fa obɛɛn, yi éyoo bee, yi émwɛn bee me mviil, yi étal bee ngesɛ, bvool yi ékyɛɛl mviɔɔl ɛ̃ bee, eli Endɔɔ li elaã. <verse eid="1JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2" />Elaã ésuo nzuru, bee émwɛn lɔ bvool eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a lɔ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn bee etsal byɛ nsia yi elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu li éli ola Taal bvool li ésuo nzuru ola bee. <verse eid="1JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3" />Yi éyoo bee bvool yi émwɛn bee, bee eyɛɛn byɛ yɔ, kwɛn byɛ hɛ̃ ekal ye bvoo ye bee. Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, bvoo a bia-byɛ eli ye Taal, ye Muaan a ndɛ, Yeso Mãsiya. <verse eid="1JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bee, bee ekel mɔ̃ kwɛn esɛ e byɛ ekal ɔ̃koo.<verse eid="1JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nziã oli mwiĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5" />Nsia yi éyoo bee ola Yeso Mãsia, bvool yi eyɛɛn bee byɛ, yɛn Nziã oli mwiĩ, empeel k'eli onse ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6" />Okɛɛn bia-byɛ ebeyɛɛn wɛn bia-byɛ eli ye bvoo ye ndɛ, kwɛn ŋɛn bia-byɛ ebedzuu onse empeel, bia-byɛ baal a mfya eli, bia-byɛ k'esa ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki etam otaa-taa wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7" />Kɛn okɛɛn bia-byɛ edzuu onse mwiĩ onge b'eli ndyam onse mwiĩ, bia-byɛ eli bvoo ye bakyɛ, bvool ãkel ã Muaan a ndɛ Yeso ãsuɔɔl bia-byɛ m'obi bueel. <verse eid="1JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8" />Okɛɛn bia-byɛ eyɛɛn wɛn bia-byɛ k'eli y'obi wɛ, bia-byɛ ŋ'epfuru ãnzuru ã bia-byam, bvool otaa-taa k'oli onse bia-byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9" />Kɛn okɛɛn bia-byɛ ekiool ãbi ã bia-byɛ, Nziã oli wɛn k'akwɛɛn k'asa m'élieel ndɛ wɛ, bvool oli dzu. Obobɔ, ndɛ àdzeel ãbi ã bia-byɛ bvool àsuɔɔl bia-byɛ onse ãndɔɔ mam mbueel mɛn k'ãli dzu wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10" />Okɛɛn bia-byɛ eyɛɛn wɛn bia-byɛ k'eli y'obi wɛ, bia-byɛ ŋ'epaal Nziã mbuul a mfya, bvool Endɔɔ e ndɛ k'eli onse bia-byɛ wɛ.<verse eid="1JN 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mãsia oli ntwel a bia-byɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1" />Baan a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ nswɛn byɛ ãndɔɔ mã, kwɛn byɛ ebee obi osa. Kɛn okɛɛn mbuul osi obi, bia-byɛ eli ye ntwel tsotsoo ye Taal. Ntwel ondɛ, Yeso Mãsia wu oli dzu. <verse eid="1JN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ ndyam ákab nzuru a ndɛ me ndyam me ndɔɔ odzeel b'ãbi ã bia-byɛ, ke kɛn a mã bia-byɛ wɛ, ye mã baal b'ɔ̃kiri a nsie wueel.<verse eid="1JN 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3" />Okɛɛn bia-byɛ ekiaal ãngel ã Nziã, oŋɔ̃ bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn bia-byɛ eyɛɛ ndɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4" />Ŋɛn mbuul olieel ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ Nziã», kɛn a ndɛ k'akiaal ãngel ã ndɛ wɛ, ndɛ oli nga-mfya bvool otaa-taa k'oli onse ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5" />Kɛn a wu okwee Endɔɔ e Nziã, dzii li edzii ndɛ Nziã èkal lam ɔ̃koo. Oŋɔ̃ bia-byɛ bu eyɛɛ bam wɛn bia-byɛ eli onse ndɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6" />Mbuul wu oyɛɛn ndiri ndɛ abekal onse Mãsia, ebvaan ndɛ hɛ̃ adzuu onge b'édzuu Mãsia ndyam.<verse eid="1JN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, k'eli ngel yi alili yi nswɛn mɛ̃ byɛ wɛ, eli ngel yi tsɔɔn yi éyɔɔ byɛ fa obɛɛn. Ngel yi tsɔɔn oyɔ, eli Endɔɔ li éyoo byɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8" />Ke yam, mɛ̃ byɛ ngel yi alili nswɛn, yɔ emɔɔn onse Mãsia bvool onse byɛ, ke ngwel wɛ lempeel emeebwel bvool mwiĩ wa taa-taa oyii anyɛɛn. <verse eid="1JN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9" />Mbuul wu ayɛɛn ndiri ndɛ abekal onse mwiĩ, kwɛn ŋɛn ndɛ abebyal muaan-ngoo a ndɛ, ndɛ ŋ'ali kɛn onse lempeel. <verse eid="1JN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10" />Wu odzii muaan-ngoo a ndɛ oli onse mwiĩ, bvool onse ndɛ k'eli y'eluɔ ki ebal ndɛ onse obi wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11" />Kɛn wu oli ye byal e muaan-ngoo a ndɛ oli onse lempeel, ndɛ abedzuu onse lempeel bvool k'ayɛɛ mboo yi ebeyi ndɛ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ lempeel efoo ndɛ mviil.<verse eid="1JN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12" />Baan a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ nswɛn byɛ ɔ̃nkaan wu, ke ngwel wɛ adzeel ãbi ã byɛ me nkuũ a Mãsia. <verse eid="1JN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13" />Byɛ b'atal, mɛ̃ nswɛn byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eyɛɛ wu oli fa obɛɛn. Byɛ b'ãnsam, mɛ̃ nswɛn byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ ebvel wu li Ɔ̃bi. <verse eid="1JN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14" />Baan a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ nswɛn byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eyɛɛ Taal. Byɛ b'atal, mɛ̃ nswɛn byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eyɛɛ wu oli fa obɛɛn. Byɛ b'ãnsam, mɛ̃ nswɛn byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eli ye mpɛn, Endɔɔ e Nziã eli onse byɛ bvool byɛ ebvel wu li Ɔ̃bi. <verse eid="1JN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15" />Ebee ɔ̃kiri odzii onkyam k'emã ki eli onse ɔ̃kiri. Ŋɛn mbuul odzii ɔ̃kiri, ndɛ olɔ k'abedzii Taal wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bvieel bvi li onse ɔ̃kiri: Efua bvi ombuul, efua bvi ebi-ebi bvi mviil, y'ondɛɛl o nzuru me ndɔɔ opfel, obvɛ bvieel k'efa ola Taal wɛ, kɛn a bvɛ efa onse ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="1JN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17" />Ɔ̃kiri abwel y'efua e ndɛ bvieel hɛ̃, kɛn a wu asa b'edzii Nziã akal ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu.<verse eid="1JN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃taal a Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18" />Baan a mɛ̃, li eli lio li ntɔ! Byɛ eyoo áyɛɛn ndiri Ɔ̃taal a Mãsia akieel aya, ke yam ataal a Mãsia bibi amaapal meba, oŋɔ̃ bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn li eli lio li ntɔ. <verse eid="1JN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19" />Bɔ apal onse bia-byɛ. Ke yam, bɔ k'áli ba bia-byɛ wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ okɛɛn áli ba bia-byɛ, bɔ ákaakal ye bia-byɛ, kɛn oŋɔ̃ ŋ'asuo kal-a-kal ndiri si ekal ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ k'áli wa bia-byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20" />Me b'otal byɛ, wu Ɔ̃nsensal osuul byɛ ba ngel, obobɔ byɛ bueel eli y'oyɛɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21" />Mɛ̃ nswɛn byɛ ɔ̃nkaan, ke me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ edzɛɛn otaa-taa wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eyɛɛ bɔ bvool byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn mfya si mbwel k'ekoo k'efa onse otaa-taa wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22" />K'oŋɔ̃ nga-mfya nã? Eli wu abee ndiri Yeso k'ali Mãsia wɛ. Ndɛ ondɛ wu oli ɔ̃taal a Mãsia, ndɛ wɛn ekuu emɔ̃, abee Taal ye Muaan. <verse eid="1JN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23" />Mbuul wueel wu abee Muaan, ŋɛn k'ali ye Taal wɛ. Wu akiool Muaan, ŋ'ali hɛ̃ ye Taal. <verse eid="1JN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24" />Me b'otal byɛ, Endɔɔ li eyoo byɛ fa obɛɛn, ekwɛɛ lɔ. Okɛɛn Endɔɔ li eyoo byɛ fa obɛɛn ekal onse byɛ, byɛ hɛ̃, byɛ ekal onse Muaan bvool onse Taal. <verse eid="1JN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25" />Lɔɔ li ewi ndɛ bia-byɛ li elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal-a-ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="1JN 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26" />Mɛ̃ nswɛn byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a baal b'asuul byɛ edziɔɔn. <verse eid="1JN 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27" />Me b'otal byɛ, Ɔ̃fel wu éyɔɔ byɛ abekal onse byɛ, obobɔ byɛ k'eli ye kɔɔ kwɛn ayiool byɛ wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɔ̃fel wu éyɔɔ byɛ abeyiool byɛ mbueel, bvool m'ebeyiool ndɛ ãli mã taa-taa, ke mfya wɛ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ekal onse ndɛ, onge b'eyiool Ɔ̃fel byɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28" />Baan a mɛ̃, ekal onse Mãsia, kwɛn ŋ'ekieel emɔɔn ndɛ, bia-byɛ ekal y'ãŋã bvool ebee y'opfuru okal ke nkwel a ndɛ ŋ'ekieel eya ndɛ.<verse eid="1JN 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29" />Okɛɛn byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn ndɛ oli dzu, oŋɔ̃ eyɛɛ wɛn mbuul ɔ̃bi pyɛ wu asa ãndɔɔ mã dzu oli muaan a ndɛ.<verse eid="1JN 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Baan a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1" />Etal dzii li edzii Taal bia-byɛ, kwɛn bia-byɛ ekal baan a Nziã. Ngwanyã, bia-byɛ eli baan a ndɛ. Okɛɛn ɔ̃kiri k'ayɛɛ bia-byɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, meba ŋã bia-byɛ eli baan a Nziã, kɛn emfa ki ekieel ekal bia-byɛ kɛn emɔɔn wɛ. Kɛn a ŋ'ekieel emɔɔn Mãsia, bia-byɛ ekal emfa ngemɔ̃ onge ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bia-byɛ ekieel emwɛn ndɛ onge b'eli ndɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3" />Mbuul wueel wu ata kaã olɔ me ndɛ àkal mbuul wa tsɛtsɛ onge b'eli ndyam tsɛtsɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4" />Mbuul wueel wu asa obi afel ngel a Nziã, ke ngwel wɛ osa b'obi oli ofel o ngel a Nziã. <verse eid="1JN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5" />Kɛn a byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn, Yeso Mãsia oyi me ndɔɔ yi ambaal ãbi, onse ndɛ k'eli y'obi wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6" />M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul wueel wu akal onse ndɛ k'asa obi wɛ, kɛn a wu asa obi ŋɛn k'ayɛɛ ndɛ wɛ, bvool lɔɔ-okal kɛn amwɛn ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7" />Baan a mɛ̃, mbuul abee byɛ opfuru. Mbuul wu asa ãndɔɔ mã dzu oli dzu onge b'eli Mãsia ndyam dzu. <verse eid="1JN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8" />Mbuul wu asa obi oli wu Ɔ̃pfu, ke ngwel wɛ Ɔ̃pfu ási obi fa obɛɛn. Okɛɛn Muaan a Nziã oyi, me ndɔɔ yi abiil ɛ̃sal mi Ɔ̃pfu. <verse eid="1JN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9" />Mbuul wueel wu oyii muaan a Nziã k'asa obi wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ekwɛn e Nziã ebekal onse ndɛ. Ndɛ k'akoo k'asa obi wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oli muaan a Nziã. <verse eid="1JN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10" />Etal emfa ki esuo okam mpɛɛ̃-a-mpɛɛ̃ a baan a Nziã ye b'ɔ̃pfu: Mbuul wueel wɛn k'asa ãndɔɔ mã dzu wɛ, wuo k'adzii muaan-ngoo a ndɛ wɛ k'ali wa Nziã wɛ.<verse eid="1JN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dzii e bakyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11" />Nsia yi eyoo byɛ fa obɛɛn, yɔ bu: Bia-byɛ ekal ye dzii e bakyɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12" />Bia-byɛ ebee onge Kayiin okal. Ndɛ áli wa wu Ɔ̃bi bvool ábam mvɔɔl a ndɛ. K'otsɛn omã b'ébam ndɛ ndɛ? Me ndɔɔ yɛn ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ wu Kayiin ɛ̃́li ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi, kɛn a mi mvɔɔl ɛ̃́li dzu. <verse eid="1JN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13" />Andoo a dzii, ebee okam, okɛɛn ɔ̃kiri abyal byɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14" />Me b'otal bia-byɛ, bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn bia-byɛ émeefa onse epfu, émeesam onse elaã. Bia-byɛ eyɛɛ obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bia-byɛ edzii andoo a dzii. Mbuul wɛn k'ali ye dzii wɛ abekal onse epfu. <verse eid="1JN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15" />Mbuul wueel wu abyal muaan-ngoo a ndɛ oli ɔ̃bam a baal. Kɛn a byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn ɔ̃bam a baal si ngɔmɔ̃ wu oli y'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu onse ndɛ pyɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16" />Emfa ki eyɛɛ bia-byɛ dzii kyɛ bu: Mãsia owi omwiĩ o ndɛ me ndyam me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, bia-byɛ hɛ̃ ebvaan ewa omwiĩ o bia-byɛ me ndɔɔ andoo a dzii. <verse eid="1JN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17" />Okɛɛn mbuul oli y'opfel b'ɔ̃kiri wu, ndɛ amwɛn muaan-ngoo a ndɛ okaan, kɛn a ndɛ akuru ndɛ okwal, emfa emã kyɛn ndɛ okoo k'ayɛɛn ndiri ndɛ odzii Nziã? <verse eid="1JN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18" />Baan a mɛ̃, bia-byɛ ebee dzii osuo kɛn a m'ɔ̃nywã y'ãyɛɛn m'ãbvɛ-ãbvɛ, esuo dzii m'ɛ̃sal y'otaa-taa.<verse eid="1JN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bia-byɛ ke nkwel a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19" />Okyɛ emfa ki èyɛɛ bia-byɛ wɛn bia-byɛ eli baal b'otaa-taa, bvool ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bia-byɛ k'ɛ̃kal ke ywel ke nkwel a Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20" />Ŋɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bia-byɛ ɛ̃fɛn bia-byɛ, Nziã onduru ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bia-byɛ, bvool oyɛɛ mbueel. <verse eid="1JN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, okɛɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bia-byɛ k'ɛ̃fɛn bia-byɛ wɛ, myɛ̃ k'ɛ̃kal ke ywel ke nkwel a Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22" />Bvam bvieel bvi esɔɔ bia-byɛ ola ndɛ, ndɛ àwa bia-byɛ bvɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bia-byɛ ebekiaal ãngel ã ndɛ bvool ebesa b'edzii ndɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23" />Ngel a ndɛ, yɔ bu: Ebvaan bia-byɛ elɔ okiool me nkuũ a Muaan a ndɛ Yeso Mãsia bvool edzii bakyɛ m'emfa e ngel yi ewi ndɛ bia-byɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24" />Mbuul wu abekiaal ãngel ã ndɛ abekal onse Nziã, bvool Nziã abekal onse ndɛ. Etal emfa ki eyɛɛ bia-byɛ wɛn Nziã abekal onse bia-byɛ: eli me nkuul a Ɔ̃fel wu ewi ndɛ bia-byɛ.<verse eid="1JN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃fel wa Nziã y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃taal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, ebee ɔ̃fel wueel okiool, kɛn byɛ ebvaan ebwɛɛl ɛ̃fel ngesɛ, me ndɔɔ yi etal okɛɛn myɛ̃ ɛ̃fi ola Nziã. Ke ngwel wɛ, aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn bibi ba mfya amaaya m'ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="1JN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2" />Etal emfa ki eyɛɛ byɛ Ɔ̃fel wa Nziã: ɔ̃fel ndyam wueel wu ayɛɛn ndiri Yeso Mãsia áyi m'emfa ki mbuul, ondɛ ɔ̃fel wu ofi ola Nziã. <verse eid="1JN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3" />Kɛn ɔ̃fel wueel wɛn k'akiool ndiri Yeso áfi ola Nziã wɛ, k'ali wa Nziã wɛ. Ndɛ oli ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃taal a Mãsia. Byɛ éyoo ndiri ndɛ ákeya, kɛn a meba ŋã, ndɛ amaaya onse ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="1JN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4" />Kɛn a byɛ be baan a mɛ̃, byɛ eli ba Nziã bvool byɛ ebvel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn ba mfya, ke ngwel wɛ wu oli onse byɛ onduru wu oli onse ɔ̃kiri waan. <verse eid="1JN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5" />Bɔ, bɔ ali b'ɔ̃kiri. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ãyɛɛn ã bɔ ãli m'ɔ̃kiri, bvool ɔ̃kiri abeyoo bɔ. <verse eid="1JN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6" />Kɛn a bia-byɛ, bia-byɛ eli ba Nziã. Mbuul wu oyɛɛ Nziã ayoo bia-byɛ. Wɛn k'ali wa Nziã wɛ k'ayoo bia-byɛ wɛ. Okyɛ emfa ki eyɛɛ bia-byɛ wɛn, wu Ɔ̃fel wu otaa-taa, wu ɔ̃fel wu apfuru.<verse eid="1JN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nziã oli dzii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, bia-byɛ edzii bakyɛ, ke ngwel wɛ dzii efi ola Nziã. Mbuul wueel wu adzii bakyɛ oli muaan a Nziã bvool oyɛɛ ndɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8" />Wɛn k'adzii bakyɛ wɛ, k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã oli dzii. <verse eid="1JN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9" />Etal emfa ki ésuo Nziã bia-byɛ dzii e ndɛ: ndɛ oyuɔɔl ensuu e ndɛ e Muaan ngɔmɔ̃ onse ɔ̃kiri, kwɛn bia-byɛ ekal y'elaã me ndɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10" />Dzii olɔ, ke lɛn ndiri bia-byɛ edzii Nziã wɛ, lɛn ndɛ odzii bia-byɛ, bu ayuɔɔl Muaan a ndɛ wu ákab nzuru a ndɛ me ndyam, me ndɔɔ odzeel b'ãbi ã bia-byɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, okɛɛn Nziã odzii bia-byɛ m'emfa okyɛ, bia-byɛ hɛ̃ ebvaan edzii bakyɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12" />Mbuul lɔɔ-okal kɛn amwɛn Nziã wɛ. Okɛɛn bia-byɛ edzii bakyɛ, Nziã akal onse bia-byɛ bvool dzii e ndɛ eli li ɔ̃koo onse bia-byɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13" />Emfa ki eyɛɛ bia-byɛ wɛn bia-byɛ ebekal onse Nziã bvool wɛn ndɛ abekal onse bia-byɛ, kyɛ ki: Ndɛ owi bia-byɛ Ɔ̃fel a ndɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14" />Bee, bee emwɛn bvool eyɛɛn bam wɛn, Taal áyuɔɔl Muaan a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi akal Ɔ̃mbvuul a ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="1JN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15" />Ŋɛn mbuul okiool ndiri Yeso oli Muaan a Nziã, Nziã akal onse mbuul ondɛ bvool ndɛ akal onse Nziã. <verse eid="1JN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16" />Bia-byɛ eyɛɛ bvool ekiool wɛn Nziã odzii bia-byɛ. Nziã oli dzii, mbuul wu akal onse dzii akal onse Nziã bvool Nziã akal onse ndɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17" />Ŋɛn dzii eli ɔ̃koo onse bia-byɛ, ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bia-byɛ k'ɛ̃kal ke ywel wɛ me tsoo li ètsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal. Ke ngwel wɛ, emfa ki eli ndɛ bam, emfa ki eli bia-byɛ hɛ̃ onse ɔ̃kiri wu. <verse eid="1JN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18" />Onse dzii, buɔ k'oli wɛ. Kɛn a dzii li ɔ̃koo etswɛɛl buɔ. Ke ngwel wɛ, buɔ osuo kwɛn mbuul abekiaal etumbu. Wu oli ye buɔ, dzii k'eli ɔ̃koo onse ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19" />Me b'otal bia-byɛ, bia-byɛ ebedzii bakyɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn Nziã ádzii bia-byɛ ɛ̃kwel. <verse eid="1JN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20" />Ŋɛn mbuul oyɛɛn ndiri: «Mɛ̃ dzii Nziã», kwɛn ŋɛn ndɛ abyal nga-buru mbuul, ndɛ oli nga-mfya. Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wɛn k'adzii nga-buru mbuul wu emwɛn ndɛ wɛ, ndɛ k'akoo k'adzii Nziã wɛ, Nziã wɛn ndɛ k'amwɛn wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21" />Obobɔ, ngel yi ewi Mãsia bia-byɛ, yɔ yi: Mbuul wu odzii Nziã, ebvaan ndɛ hɛ̃ adzii nga-buru mbuul.<verse eid="1JN 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ki ebvel ɔ̃kiri emã?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1" />Mbuul wueel wu akiool ndiri Yeso oli Mãsia, oli muaan a Nziã, bvool mbuul wueel wu odzii Nziã wu ɔ̃buru, wu odzii Muaan wu eburu ndɛ hɛ̃. <verse eid="1JN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2" />Emfa ki eyɛɛ bia-byɛ wɛn bia-byɛ edzii baan a Nziã, eli okɛɛn bia-byɛ edzii Nziã bvool esa b'etam ãngel ã ndɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, odzii o Nziã eli okiaal b'ãngel ã ndɛ. Bvool ãngel ã ndɛ k'ãli ye mpal m'okiaal wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, muaan a Nziã wueel abvel ɔ̃kiri. Bvool ki ebvel ɔ̃kiri, eli okiool o bia-byɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5" />Wu obvel ɔ̃kiri nã? Eli kɛn a wu akiool ndiri Yeso oli Muaan a Nziã.<verse eid="1JN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amwɛn a Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6" />Ndɛ wu Yeso Mãsia wu oyi me nkuul a ãdza y'ãkel. Ndɛ k'ayi kɛn a y'ãdza ãtu wɛ, ndɛ oyi y'ãdza bvool y'ãkel. Ɔ̃fel oli wu ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ oyɔ, ke ngwel wɛ Ɔ̃fel oli otaa-taa. <verse eid="1JN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7" />Amwɛn ali b'ange-atyel ba: <verse eid="1JN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8" />Ɔ̃fel, ãdza y'ãkel, bvool bɔ ange-atyel ali ɔ̃nguo ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="1JN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9" />Bia-byɛ ebekiool m'eyɛɛn baal, kɛn m'eyɛɛn Nziã ãnduru ɔ̃bvɛn ndyam. M'eyɛɛn Nziã ãli me ndɔɔ a Muaan a ndɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10" />Obobɔ, mbuul wu olɔ okiool me Muaan a Nziã oli y'ãyɛɛn omɔ̃ onse ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ. Kɛn a wɛn k'ali y'okiool me Nziã wɛ, ŋ'apaal ndɛ wu Nziã mbuul a mfya, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ k'alɔ okiool o ndɛ me m'elieel Nziã me ndɔɔ a Muaan a ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11" />Oyɛɛn obɔ, oli bubu: Nziã owi bia-byɛ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. Elaã olɔ eli onse Muaan a ndɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12" />Mbuul wu oli ye Muaan oli y'elaã. Wɛn k'ali ye Muaan a Nziã wɛ, k'ali y'elaã wɛ.<verse eid="1JN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13" />Mɛ̃ nkel byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn byɛ eli y'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu, byɛ b'eli y'okiool me nkuũ a Muaan a Nziã. <verse eid="1JN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14" />Bia-byɛ eli y'ãŋã m'eyi ola ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn, okɛɛn bia-byɛ esɔɔ eluɔ k'emã, m'emfa ki edzii ndɛ, ndɛ ayoo bia-byɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15" />Bvool okɛɛn bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn ndɛ ayoo bia-byɛ, eluɔ kyam k'emã ki esɔɔ bia-byɛ, bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn bia-byɛ emeebɔɔ ki esɔɔ bia-byɛ ola ndɛ.<verse eid="1JN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16" />Ŋɛn mbuul omwɛn muaan-ngoo a ndɛ asa obi bɛn k'obiri ke lepfu wɛ, ebvaan ndɛ abuɛɛn, obobɔ Nziã àwa muaan-ngoo a ndɛ elaã. Ndɔɔ oyɔ etal baal b'asa obi bɛn k'obiri ke lepfu wɛ. Eli y'obi b'obiri k'epfu. Mɛ̃ ke ntam wɛn abuɛɛn me ndɔɔ obi obɔ wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17" />Ndɔɔ yam yueel yi mbi-mbi eli obi, kɛn eli y'obi bɛn k'obiri ke lepfu wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18" />Bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn, mbuul wueel wu eburu Nziã k'asa obi wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ Muaan a Nziã akiaal ndɛ, bvool wu Ɔ̃bi k'akoo k'aywɛn me ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19" />Bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn bia-byɛ eli ba Nziã, kɛn ɔ̃kiri wueel oli ke nsɛn okwɛn o wu Ɔ̃bi. <verse eid="1JN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20" />Bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn Muaan a Nziã oyi, ndɛ owi bia-byɛ ãyal me ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛ Nziã wa taa-taa, bvool bia-byɛ eli onse Nziã wa taa-taa, onse Muaan a ndɛ Yeso Mãsia. Nziã wa taa-taa eli ndɛ, elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu eli ndɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21" />Baan a mɛ̃, ekal y'onkyab m'anziã b'etiɔ!<verse eid="1JN 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5" />
</usx>